    <div class="eyebrow">01 — Context</div>
    <h2>Context</h2>
    <p>Hazus is a hazard analysis platform used by federal agencies, urban planners, emergency managers, and hazard mitigation professionals to assess risk from natural disasters.</p>
    <p>Despite its importance, the existing workflow for conducting location-based risk analysis is built on an outdated desktop system that has not kept pace with modern user experience standards.</p>

    <h3>Current Design</h3>
